  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "As there's a high volume of posts every day (canny posts), it is quite impossible for the VRChat team to go through all of them. It would be good if we could mark our own posts as completed or resolved so the VRChat team doesn't have to go through so many in the first place. For example I would like to mark my post as resolved/completed: https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/osc-doesnt-work-with-vpn-mullvad. My post could be also used as a reference for other users trying to solve this niche issue. The post being marked as completed/resolved would help these users quite a lot.",
